<title>USA: Tyco International sets $300 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Tyco International sets $300 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Tyco International Ltd was priced on Tuesday, according to sole manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER TYCO INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.479  FIRST PAY DATE 05/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2    YIELD 6.624 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +47 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
